3. what the recipe would have to do, spelled out
==============================================================================
  training reaction 2 is  H2+ + H-  ->  H2 + H.
  The electron that arrives on H2+ becomes the SECOND electron of the H-H bond.
  The recipe has only LOSE_CHARGE/GAIN_CHARGE -- no bond-forming action -- so from an
